  "details": "There seems to be a bug or issue upon startup for VRChat via Steam. It took me 3 tries to log in and load into a world. The two tries before that, I was stuck in the blue orb loading screen with no menu or pop-ups, just music. Steam is also taking unusually long to load up the Easy Anti-Cheat window; approximately a minute. (Prior to this issue, earlier today, I have also had issues closing VRChat via Steam, and having to either close it manually via the window, or neither working and some angel loaded me into a world to be able to hit the Log Off button.) I also restarted my WiFi, and everything else seems to work just fine. Not sure what the cause is :<",
